<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Finance (HK) sets HK$500 mln term loan.</title>
<headline>Pacific Finance (HK) sets HK$500 mln term loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p>The borrower is equally owned by Jardine Matheson &amp; Co and Jardine Fleming Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PACIFIC FINANCE (HONG KONG) LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$500 MLN  TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN   1,3,6MH+50BP  MATURITY  39 MONTHS  AVGE LIFE  3 YRS</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 LAUNCH    19.MAY.97</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN   --	    AVAIL     1 MTH	HOME CTRY HONG KONG</p>
<p> REPAYMENT  EQUAL INSTALMENTS AFTER 33 MTHS, 36 MTHS AND 39</p>
<p>		MTHS</p>
<p> GOV LAW    HONG KONG   REPLIES   02.JUN.97 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS    HK$50-70 MLN   52BP  ALL-IN  67.3</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    HK$30-49 MLN   48BP  ALL-IN  66.0</p>
<p>   SENIOR MGRS     HK$15-29 MLN   45BP  ALL-IN  65.0</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK HONG KONG (OTHER BOOKS),</p>
<p>		DRESDNER BANK, FUJI BANK (JAPANESE BOOKS) AND</p>
<p>		KLEINWORT BENSON</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
